OL,5,CLIVERPOOLFfootball fans to be
OL,6,F extradited to Belgium.........115B215
OL,8,CGULFFIran and Iraq step up
OL,9,F "tanker war"..................111B211
OL,11,CMOSCOWF"Red Square" pilot
OL,12,F goes on trial.................103B203
OL,14,CKING INCIDENTFPolice appeal
OL,15,F over car, raid caravan site...105B205
OL,17,CSPAINFAir traffic controllers
OL,18,F to strike on Saturday.........106B206
OL,20,CAIDSF#5m campaign aimed at
OL,21,F drug users....................110B210
OL,23,T]FFromC02-09-87F  teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11804
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788352493
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G4/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Twenty-six Liverpool football fans are
OL,6, to be extradited to Belgium to face
OL,7, charges of manslaughter in connection
OL,8, with the Heysel stadium disaster.
OL,10,FHome Secretary Mr Douglas Hurd said it
OL,11,Fwas right that the trial should take
OL,12,Fplace "where the harm was caused" and
OL,13,Fhe was confident that the 26 would get
OL,14,Fa fair and speedy trial.
OL,16,FBelgian Justice Minister Mr Jean Gol
OL,17,Fwelcomed Mr Hurd's decision.
OL,19,FThirty-nine people died in the riot at
OL,20,Fthe match between Liverpool and the
OL,21,FItalian side Juventus in May 1985.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11805
SC,0005
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788352493
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G5/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Attacks on shipping in the Gulf by both
OL,6, Iran and Iraq have intensified
OL,7, overnight.
OL,9,FIran attacked five more foreign ships -
OL,10,Ffour tankers and a cargo vessel - from
OL,11,FSpain, Japan, South Korea, Cyprus and
OL,12,FGreece.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FLater, Iraq said its planes had
OL,15,Fhit three "large maritime targets"
OL,16,Foff the Iranian coast.
OL,18,S/FFrance has ordered three minehunters
OL,19,Fto the Gulf of Oman to start operations
OL,20,Fto clear mines in international waters.
OL,21,                  F
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11806
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788352493
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G6/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Mr Mathias Rust, the 19-year-old West
OL,6, German who landed a plane in Red Square
OL,7, in May, has gone on trial in Moscow.
OL,9,FHe told the Soviet Supreme Court he was
OL,10,Fon a peace mission prompted by the
OL,11,Ffailure of the Reykjavik summit between
OL,12,FMr Gorbachev and President Reagan.
OL,14,FMr Rust said he wanted to discuss peace
OL,15,Fwith Mr Gorbachev and had not thought
OL,16,Fabout what would happen after he landed
OL,18,FHe pleaded guilty to violating Soviet
OL,19,Fair space and to illegal entry but not
OL,20,Fguilty to malicious hooliganism. He
OL,21,Ffaces up to 10 years in jail.
OL,22,                        F
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11807
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788352493
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G7/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Wiltshire police have appealed to the
OL,6, public to help them trace a car wanted
OL,7, in connection with an incident at the
OL,8, Northern Ireland Secretary's house.
OL,10,FIt is a yellow Datsun Bluebird saloon,
OL,11,Fregistration number FHE 80V. The car is
OL,12,Fsaid to be in a rough condition.
OL,14,FEarlier today, police using underwater
OL,15,Fsearch teams and tracker dogs searched
OL,16,Fa caravan site near Bath.
OL,18,FThey looked for evidence connected
OL,19,Fwith three people detained under the
OL,20,FPrevention of Terrorism Act over
OL,21,FSunday's incident at Mr Tom King's home
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11808
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788352493
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G8/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, Spanish air traffic controllers are
OL,6, due to strike from 7am on Saturday
OL,7, after a breakdown in pay talks.
OL,9,FA strike committee official in
OL,10,FBarcelona said the 24-hour strike
OL,11,Fwould go ahead unless the men got a
OL,12,Ffirm date for the payment of back pay.
OL,14,FLeaders of Spain's tourist industry
OL,15,Fhave met the tourism minister in Madrid
OL,16,Fin an attempt to mediate.
OL,18,FLast weekend a similar strike was
OL,19,Fcalled off at the last moment but a
OL,20,Fwalk-out the week before caused days
OL,21,Fof disruption for airline passengers.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,119,180,120,250,0,100
PN,11809
SC,0009
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F118A1788352493
OL,1,  V<,,4<,,4<,,4Spp0pp0p``0pp0      G9/19
OL,2,T]V5b(55b(55j5Sj5.%jj5/l4
OL,3,  V-,,%-,,%-,,%S#"!##!###!##!
OL,5, The Government has started a #5 million
OL,6, campaign against drug abuse and AIDS.
OL,8,FSocial Services Secretary Mr John Moore
OL,9,Fwarned of the dangers of sharing
OL,10,Fneedles and syringes and said as many
OL,11,Fas one in two drug addicts are infected
OL,12,Fwith the AIDS virus.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThe adverts are designed to shock and
OL,15,Fuse graphic and explicit images. One
OL,16,Fshows a corpse in a polythene sheet
OL,17,Fwith an AIDS sticker attached.
OL,18,F
OL,19,FMr Moore has described the campaign as
OL,20,Fhard hitting and said that some people
OL,21,Fmight find it disturbing.
OL,23,T]CFrom 02-09-87   teletextarchive.com
